~ start
Achieng returned to Ekonu haven retrieved the fragments of the light source.
As she neared the Orb, the fragments merged and released a dazzling light, findling its way back to its home.
Finally, Lumusi was in full swing. Laughter and Joy filled the air, as the people danced and sang.
Achieng watched the Orb in the sky and felt she finally understood why they celebrated.
It wasn't just about the rise of the sun, 
It was about the path her ancestors had treaded, 
The vision of the land for the morrow,
and Spirit to bring it to pass.
They were light, and light would always shine in the darkness.
=> END
